        {
          "text": "Modern infrastructure requires authentication models designed for both human users and automated systems. With PATs, SATs, workload identity federation, and upcoming OAuth support, Datadog’s new authentication model gives teams more granular control over identity, credential scope, and access life cycles across developer workflows, automation systems, and AI agents.",
